Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["SymmetryConfluenceMutation", "ObjectName",
 CellID->280522689,ExpressionUUID->"4dde924d-6ac8-3f4e-9d58-a0980e89f05a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"90ee5902-1705-124b-b782-322902931a17"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["SymmetryConfluenceMutation",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
SymmetryConfluenceMutation"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "rule", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "264b547a-2aa2-7e44-a08e-b8a59be39614"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "proposes a symmetry/confluence mutation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rule", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "1412ea85-6757-2740-a45b-b8a77fb52cb7"],
 "."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->860599704,ExpressionUUID->"dae181ea-29fc-5e4c-b825-129c52cc8e10"],

Cell["\<\
This is catalog strategy 3, \"SymmetryConfluence\", of the approved \
15-strategy mutation catalog.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->535472957,ExpressionUUID->"dc4f9b09-dfba-0847-892a-8d4c8f3f91bb"],

Cell["\<\
Operators: IdentifyVariables (merge two variables), SymmetrizeRHS (close the \
right-hand side under an exchange of interchangeable variables) and, in the \
ordered and declared universes, PermuteRHS (permute the slots of one \
right-hand edge).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->537717284,ExpressionUUID->"e3e6dbe2-71ac-5542-a5e5-c35cc2e231a2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The strategy is opt-in: select it with \"MutationStrategies\" -> \
{\"SymmetryConfluence\"} in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/SamuelFrerichs/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/StructureAdaptiveEvolution.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5bedd8d9-2e70-7f4e-93ef-11aaa64be26d"],
 ", or with \"Goal\" -> \"SymmetryConfluence\", whose preset also promotes \
the catalog's primary objectives for the strategy to Pareto objectives."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->642165036,ExpressionUUID->"a11a3c7e-55e5-124f-8bb1-aa07bb004f3e"],

Cell["\<\
Mutations are random. The result is a canonically new rule (or rule set), an \
Association with \"Rule\" and \"Details\", or a Failure when no valid new \
proposal exists. Inside a search, every operator that ran is recorded in the \
candidate's provenance.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->890487247,ExpressionUUID->"d0ff5e4b-1663-d841-a10b-f5d869cf48ae"]
}, Open  ]],

